    <string name="library_save_title">Saving takes it out of DUCAT</string>
    <string name="library_save_body">A page DUCAT fetches is shown by DUCAT: scripts off, nothing allowed to reach the network. A file cannot be shown that way. Whatever opens it is an ordinary reader on an ordinary connection, and both PDFs and e-books can be built to fetch something the moment they are opened — which tells whoever published it that you read it, and when.

The issue is yours to keep. This is only what it costs to read it somewhere else.</string>
